{"3003120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Zombiehood","steam_appid":3003120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4625150],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, loot, adapt, survive. <i>Zombiehood<\/i> is a quirky yet brutal roguelite where every run throws new weapons, gear, artifacts, and rising threats at you. Ammo is scarce, the dead keep evolving, and one smart build can turn a desperate run into total domination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE COMBAT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is deceptively deep. Cripple enemies by blasting off a leg, punch through armor, exploit weak points, and adapt to different types of enemies with the right weapons and gear. Tight movement keep you alive when the horde closes in, while a constantly changing arsenal  keeps every fight fresh.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Player defending a house in the woods from an oncoming horde\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMERGENT ROGUELITE SYSTEMS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful artifacts, stack game-changing modifiers, and shape each run around new combinations. Death resets the world, but not your progress. Earn skill points, weapon parts, and blueprints to unlock skills, grow stronger, and push deeper on every attempt.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Displays a handful of artifact descriptions\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAP VARIETY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes built from handcrafted level pools that generate procedurally each run, making no two playthroughs alike. Discover shops to restock, heal, and gear up, as well as facing random events that can either aid or hinder your path. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Player walking through different biomes and buildings\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Escalating Global Difficulty<\/strong><\/i><br>The longer you survive, the dead grow stronger, smarter, and more varied. Greater danger also means greater rewards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels<\/strong><\/i><br> A shifting overworld, randomized level pools, and changing loot keep every run unpredictable.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Arsenal<\/strong><br>Experiment with a wide range of weapons, equipment, and artifacts to create distinct playstyles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Meta Progression<\/strong><br>Earn permanent upgrades through skill points, blueprints, and weapon parts between runs.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shops &amp; Random Events<\/strong><br>Restock supplies, buy new gear, and face unpredictable events that can help or challenge your survival.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle<\/strong><br>Night changes the pace and pressure, forcing you to adapt as visibility shifts.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Player getting flung out the window of a tall building by an enemy.\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, loot, adapt, survive. <i>Zombiehood<\/