20\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Displays a handful of artifact descriptions\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAP VARIETY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes built from handcrafted level pools that generate procedurally each run, making no two playthroughs alike. Discover shops to restock, heal, and gear up, as well as facing random events that can either aid or hinder your path. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.poster.avif?t=1790122560\" aria-label=\"Player walking through different biomes and buildings\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.webm?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3003120\/extras\/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.mp4?t=1790122560\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Escalating Global Difficulty<\/strong><\/i><br>The longer you survive, the dead grow stronger, smarter, and more varied. Greater danger also means greater rewards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Pr